    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"Grab some timeseries profiles from Simbench\\n\",\n",
    "    \"=========\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"We need some timeseries profiles. Here is some quick code to grab those profiles (do not want to belabor the point here).\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"We create a `net.profiles` Dataframe to emulate the structure of the simbench grid.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
